  Slug: peachchild-leshy
  DisplayName: Peachchild Leshy
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your leshy spirit took hold in a massive peach fruit before your body
    split forth from it, possibly emulating a past hero who was born in the same
    manner. You look like a human child, though with a perpetual flush of pink to
    your complexion and perhaps a few peach leaves growing from your body. The nature
    spirit inside you puts certain animals at ease. You can ask questions of and
    receive answers from household animals and livestock, such as dogs or pheasants,
    as well as use Diplomacy to Make an Impression on and Request things of them.
    Most domesticated animals have an indifferent or friendly starting attitude toward
    you and give you time to make your case, though other animals react to you like
    any other adventurer.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide
